      "In a large zip-top plastic bag, combine wings and 1 Tbsp. Cajun Honey seasoning and shake until evenly seasoned.",
      "In a large bowl, combine rice flour, cornstarch, baking powder, and remaining 1 Tbsp. Cajun Honey seasoning.",
      "Toss wings in flour mixture and shake off any excess. Arrange in air fryer basket in a single layer and lightly spray with avocado oil.",
