      "Spread strawberry filling all the way to the edges of dough. Starting on a long side, roll into a tight log. Trim ends and cut into 12 pieces, about 1 1/2\" thick. Place in prepared pan cut sides down and tightly cover with plastic wrap. Refrigerate at least 8 hours or up to 12.",
