      "3 cups heavy cream",
      "1 tsp. pure vanilla extract",
      "1 (12-oz.)&nbsp;box vanilla wafer cookies",
      "4 bananas, sliced into coins",
      "2 tsp. granulated sugar",
      "1 (3-qt.) trifle dish"
