      "3/4 cup packed light brown sugar",
      "3 large eggs, beaten to blend",
      "1 cup light corn syrup",
      "1 tbsp. pure vanilla extract",
      "1/2 tsp. kosher salt",
      "2 cups pecan halves",
      "Vanilla ice cream, for serving"
