      "Add flour and stir to coat vegetables. Cook, stirring, until flour is distributed, about 2 minutes. Add milk, broth, mustard, garlic powder, and ½ tsp. salt, whisking to combine. Increase heat to high and bring to a boil. Immediately reduce heat to medium and simmer, stirring often, until thickened, 3 to 5 minutes. Fold in chicken and peas; season with salt and pepper, if needed.",
      "Transfer mixture to a 13\" x 9\" baking dish. Arrange biscuits on top of filling; season all over with salt and pepper.",
