      "1 (15-oz.) can fire-roasted tomatoes",
      "1 cup frozen corn",
      "1/4 cup chopped fresh cilantro, plus more for serving",
      "1 tbsp. chili powder",
      "1 tbsp. ground cumin",
      "1 tsp. kosher salt",
