      "In a small saucepan, whisk together hot sauce and honey. Bring to simmer then stir in butter. Cook until butter is melted and slightly reduced, about 2 minutes. Heat broiler on low. Transfer baked wings to a bowl and toss with buffalo sauce until completely coated. Return wings to rack and broil—watching carefully!—until sauce caramelizes, 3 minutes. Serve with <a href=\"https://www.delish.com/cooking/recipe-ideas/a25634518/ranch-dressing-recipe/\" target=\"_blank\">ranch dressing</a> and vegetables."
