      "Divide soup among bowls. Top with mozzarella, croutons, remaining torn basil, and a drizzle of balsamic glaze.<br/>"
    ],
    "servings": "6 - 8 serving(s)",
    "description": "Pillowy soft gnocchi, tomatoes, fresh mozzarella, and sweet basil make this the ultimate tomato soup. "
