        "thumbnailUrl": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/vidthumb/902a6c10-efc6-4928-98d8-b72d862dd481/thumb_1080x1920.0000001.jpg?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "1793153708071",
    "name": "Slow-Cooker Chicken Alfredo",
    "image": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/slow-cooker-chicken-alfredo-socialindex-web-049-lp-hi-res-del109925-6914dc785461f.jpg?crop=0.502xw:1.00xh;0.412xw,0&resize=1200:*",
    "categories": [
