        "title": "Sink Your Teeth Into Our Vampire Cupcakes",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/vampire-cupcakes-index-66eddef39bb70.jpg?crop=0.891xw:1.00xh;0.0554xw,0"
      }
    ]
