      "Bake crust until lightly golden, 12 to 15 minutes. Remove parchment and weights.",
      "Reduce oven temperature to 375°. In a large bowl, whisk apple butter, milk, and eggs until smooth. Add cinnamon, vanilla, cloves, and nutmeg and whisk to combine. ",
      "Pour filling into crust; smooth top. Crumble topping all over filling. ",
      "Bake pie until slightly jiggly in the center and topping is golden brown, 35 to 45 minutes. Let cool to room temperature, then refrigerate until chilled, at least 2 hours or up to overnight."
