      "Arrange racks in upper and lower thirds of oven; preheat to 350°. Using a large cookie scoop (about 1/4 c.), scoop dough into rounds for a total of 12. Press your finger into center of dough to create a hole. Place a caramel in the center. Pinch dough back over caramel and roll into a ball. Arrange between 2 parchment-lined baking sheets, spacing 3\" apart.",
