      "2 1/2 cups (300 g.) all-purpose flour",
      "1/2 cup plus 2 Tbsp. holiday sprinkles"
    ],
    "instructions": [
      "Arrange a rack in center of oven; preheat to 350°. In a large bowl, using a handheld mixer on medium-high speed, beat butter, brown sugar, salt, and 1 1/4 c. (250 g.) granulated sugar until light and creamy, 1 to 2 minutes. Add egg, egg yolk, and vanilla and beat, scraping down bowl with a spatula, until just combined. Add baking soda and beat until incorporated.",
