      "Leaving a 1\" border, cut out center of bread boule and scoop out the center to make a bread bowl. Tear or cut scooped out bread into 1\" pieces. Place bread bowl and bread pieces on a baking sheet. Fill bread bowl with dip.",
      "Bake dip, removing bread pieces if they start to get too dark, until warmed through, 30 to 35 minutes.",
      "Serve dip warm with toasted bread and crackers alongside."
