      "1 tbsp. cocoa powder, plus more for&nbsp;garnish",
      "6 large eggs",
      "1 1/4 cups granulated sugar",
      "1 tsp. kosher salt",
      "1 tsp. pure vanilla extract",
      "1 cup unsweetened shredded coconut, toasted",
