    "name": "Dirty Martini Steak Frites",
    "image": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/delish020124-dirty-martini-steak-frites-focus-for-fries-038-rl-index-65c95c1ae872b.jpg?crop=0.502xw:1.00xh;0.463xw,0&resize=1200:*",
    "categories": [
