      "Roll each puff pastry sheet to a 9 1/2\" x 9 1/2\" square. Sprinkle sugar over surface of puff pastry. Using rolling pin, gently pat sugar into pastry. Flip pastry sugar side down. Spread 2 Tbsp. strawberry jam over surface of puff pastry. Sprinkle with 2 Tbsp. ground strawberries. Repeat with remaining pastry and strawberry jam and 2 Tbsp. ground strawberries.",
