        "title": "Bakery-Worthy Banana Cream Pie Is Possible In Your Own Kitchen",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/banana-cream-pie1-1663882669.jpg?crop=1.00xw:0.846xh;0,0.0745xh"
      }
    ]
