        "thumbnailUrl": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/strawberry-cake-index-web-3973-jg-del049924-682dfe5ec3899.jpg?crop=0.889xw:1.00xh;0.0561xw,0"
      }
    ]
