        "thumbnailUrl": "https://hips.hearstapps.com/vidthumb/963f6c84-b0a5-47af-9f5c-8c058bc46404/thumb_1080x1920.0000001.jpg?crop=1.00xw:1.00xh;0,0"
      }
    ]
  },
