      "Using a paring knife, make a long slit in each banana lengthwise without cutting through the skin on other the side. Place a banana in the center of a sheet of foil. Fill banana with one-quarter of strawberries, 1 Tbsp. chips, and 1 Tbsp. walnuts. Crimp foil around banana to seal with seam facing up. Repeat with remaining bananas and filling. Transfer wrapped bananas to a baking sheet.",
      "Bake banana splits until warmed through and bananas have softened, 10 to 12 minutes.",
