      "Pour peaches and juices into a 2 qt. baking&nbsp;dish (such as 11\"x7\"). Sprinkle crumb topping evenly over peaches.&nbsp;",
      "Bake until topping is golden and peaches are bubbling, 45 to 50 minutes.",
      " Serve warm with ice cream, if desired."
