      "Heat broiler. In a medium bowl, mix marinara, harissa, and red pepper flakes. Spoon one-third of sauce into a large baking dish. Add chicken, slightly overlapping, and top with remaining sauce. Sprinkle with provolone and remaining 1/4 cup Parmesan.",
