      "1/3 cup sour cream",
      "2 green onions, thinly sliced, plus more for garnish",
      "2 tbsp. hot sauce (such as Cholula)",
      "1 tbsp. cayenne",
      "2 tsp. packed brown sugar",
      "2 tsp. paprika",
      "1 tsp. garlic powder",
