      "Divide orzo with feta among 4 dinner plates. Transfer chicken to a cutting board and slice each breast crosswise into thick slices. Arrange one breast on each plate with orzo. Spoon a few tablespoons of brown butter over each breast, squeeze on some lemon, and sprinkle with salt. Serve hot with lemon wedges alongside."
