      "Carefully dip bars so bottoms are coated in chocolate, then place on a parchment-lined baking sheet. Spoon remaining chocolate into a plastic bag and seal. Snip a tiny hole in corner of bag and drizzle bars with chocolate. Decorate with mini M&amp;M's (if using).",
