    "instructions": [
      "Slice tofu block in half parallel to cutting board. Arrange halves on a small baking sheet lined with 3 paper towels or a clean dish towel. Top tofu with another triple layer of paper towels or a dish towel and firmly press down to remove moisture (the paper towels will soak through immediately). Discard paper towels; sandwich tofu again with 3 fresh paper towels or a clean dish towel and top with a heavy skillet or another baking sheet weighted with a can. Let sit for 20 minutes (this expels more moisture). ",
      "Meanwhile, in a small bowl, whisk milk, nutritional yeast, garlic powder, onion powder, chili powder, turmeric, and a few grinds of pepper.",
      "Remove paper towels from tofu and discard. Crumble tofu into 1/2\" pieces in a medium bowl. ",
