      "Reduce heat to medium. Whisk seasoned soy milk to recombine, then add to skillet. Cook, stirring occasionally with a rubber spatula, until most of the moisture has evaporated and sauce coats tofu, about 1 minute. (If you like your scramble a little saucier, stop cooking when there’s still a little moisture left, after about 30 seconds.)",
      "Divide tofu mixture among plates. Top with scallions."
