      "In a small saucepan over medium heat, cook cream, brown sugar, and butter, stirring often, until thickened and a loose caramel consistency forms, about 5 minutes. Let cool slightly. ",
      "Using parchment overhang, lift out blondies and transfer to a cutting board. Drizzle with toffee sauce. Sprinkle with sea salt. Cut into squares."
