      "Serve at room temperature or refrigerate until cold. Divide pudding among small bowls or ramekins. Top with a dollop of cream.",
      "<strong>Make Ahead:</strong> Pudding can be made 3 days ahead. Store in an airtight container and refrigerate."
    ],
    "servings": "4 - 6 serving(s)",
    "description": "This sweet potato pudding recipe is the perfect Thanksgiving side dish."
  },
  {
    "id": "1793153911143",
    "name": "Sweet Potato Gnocchi",
