      "Season chicken all over with 1 1/2 tsp. salt and 1/4 tsp. pepper. Arrange on top of lemon and shallot.",
      "In a small bowl, combine garlic, butter, oregano, cumin, and 1/4 tsp. salt. Brush half of butter mixture on top of chicken; reserve remaining butter mixture.",
