      "Meanwhile, in reserved bowl, toss asparagus, reserved butter mixture, and 1/2 tsp. salt. Add asparagus mixture to baking sheet, arranging around chicken. Sprinkle with feta.",
      "Return to oven and continue to roast until asparagus is fork-tender and an instant-read thermometer inserted into thickest part of chicken registers 165°, about 10 minutes more. Top with dill."
