      "In a large bowl, mix&nbsp;4 cups vanilla ice cream until smooth and spread on partially frozen crust. Freeze for at least 30 minutes more.",
      "In the same bowl, mix strawberry ice cream until smooth.&nbsp;Stir in ½ cup freeze-dried strawberries. Spread on vanilla layer. Freeze for 30 minutes more.",
